# Vercel hosts the Next.js app in web/ only.
#
# The Python API cannot run there: ~460 MB of dependencies (OR-Tools, SciPy,
# NumPy, scikit-learn) against a 250 MB serverless limit, and a ten-second
# solve against a ten-second function timeout. It runs as a container
# instead — see deploy/Dockerfile.
#
# Excluding it here stops Vercel detecting requirements.txt at the repo root
# and trying to build a Python function, which is what "No FastAPI entrypoint
# found" and the failed deployment both were.
src/
tests/
scripts/
deploy/
data/
docs/
*.md
requirements.txt
run.sh
demo_run.txt
.venv/
